mw2er patch 0004 to fromsoftware-rs @59fbd3b (port to eldenring.exe 2.7.2.0, MODLOG 2026-10-20)

Why: Steam updated Elden Ring on 2026-10-20 to exe FileVersion 2.7.2.0 (Steam build 25827938, sha256
f9118fea2cfd8fa3901e8060bfadb1552cb2471771ded8a5b662c4e298ffb328). The crate only knew 2.7.1.0 (WW) and 2.7.1.1 (JP);
on any other exe `rva::get()` panics.

What:
- crates/eldenring/src/rva/rva_ww2720.rs (new): the RVA table for 2.7.2.0 WW, generated by the vendored
  tools/binary-mapper (source unchanged) from that exe FILE with `map --profile crates/eldenring/mapper-profile.toml
  --output rust` (built offline, nothing downloaded; work/port2720/mapper_src). 107/107 captures resolved; 103 give one
  value (74 vtables by RTTI class name, 1 class each; 29 patterns, fd4task_base_vmt's 49 matches all agree); 4 patterns had several distinct matches and the mapper took the
  first, as upstream always does: crypto_spi_registry, cs_action_button_man_execute_action_button,
  fd4param_repository_vmt, obtain_dl_user_input_manager (none used by mw2er).
- crates/eldenring/src/rva.rs: `mod rva_ww2720;`, `ERGameVersion::Ww2720`, `(LANG_ID_EN, "2.7.2.0") => Ww2720`,
  `Ww2720 => rva_ww2720::RVAS`. Ww2710 and Jp2711 are unchanged.

Checks: check_m2.ps1 check 2 replays 0001..0004 onto HEAD (0004 creates the new file, the only untracked one) and
compares byte for byte; tools/scripts/exe_sites.py turns this table into mw2er-core/src/exe_sites.rs, whose every
site the DLL checks on the loaded exe at boot (mw2er_core::exe_build::preflight) before any crate call.
